WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.080
Did you know that this guy who can turn&nbsp;
into a chicken has an even higher bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.620
than Franky? Or that many bounties&nbsp;
contain hidden messages in Japanese?

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:12.780
Or that poor Chopper, who’s always mistaken&nbsp;
for the pet of the Straw Hats actually isn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:18.060
the character with the smallest bounty in&nbsp;
One Piece? Instead, that really sad title&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.920
actually goes to Bepo, the orange jumpsuit&nbsp;
wearing polar bear from Trafalgar Law’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
crew. With only 500 berries, Bepo has a smaller&nbsp;
bounty than any other character in One Piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:34.140
which is kind of crazy considering Bepo’s fierce&nbsp;
Sulong transformation in the manga. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.560
it seems that since Bepo is a mink,&nbsp;
the World Government thinks he’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:42.480
just…an actual polar bear instead of&nbsp;
the navigator of the Heart Pirates.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.400
And the case is very similar for the&nbsp;
second highest bounty: Tony-Tony Chopper,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.140
who the government thinks is just the Straw&nbsp;
Hats’ pet. However, after the Raid on Onigashima,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:58.500
his bounty was raised to 1,000 berries: twice&nbsp;
the amount of Bepo’s bounty. If the government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:03.420
knew the truth about Chopper and that he was&nbsp;
one of the smartest members of the crew…and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:08.040
definitely smarter than his own captain…I’m&nbsp;
sure his bounty would be much, much higher.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:12.060
Now, it might be a little hard for some&nbsp;
listeners to imagine just how much 1,000&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:16.920
berries is. Since berries are worth approximately&nbsp;
the same as Japanese Yen, the means that turning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:25.200
in Chopper would earn you around 6.36 Euro&nbsp;
or 6.91 US dollars. So like…not very much.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:30.660
Now, let’s make the massive leap from&nbsp;
1,000 to 3,200,000 berries. We’re clearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:35.460
not in joke bounty territory anymore. This&nbsp;
bounty belongs to Mr. 4 of Baroque Works,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.660
who you might remember as the guy who shattered&nbsp;
all of Usopp’s bones with a baseball bat.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:46.800
Just above him is this guy at 3,400,000. His name&nbsp;
is Porchemy and we met him in Luffy’s childhood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.540
flashback. This guy worked for the pirate&nbsp;
Bluejam, and his bounty was fittingly low&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:57.360
for someone who lost a fight to two children:&nbsp;
Ace and Sabo. But what can I say, that’s what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:03.660
you sign up for when you pick on kid Luffy (and&nbsp;
by pick on I mean violently torture kid Luffy).

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:09.660
At a respectable 5,000,000 is the first pirate&nbsp;
we ever saw Luffy beat up in the series:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.380
Iron-Mace Alvida. It’s kind of wild&nbsp;
though that this is the last confirmed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.040
bounty we have for her, though -&nbsp;
one can only speculate that it’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:22.740
higher now that she’s technically on&nbsp;
a yonkou crew, working under Buggy.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:27.240
Poor Chew: it must be sad to have the&nbsp;
lowest bounty on the Arlong Pirates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:32.940
separated here from all your crew mates&nbsp;
with only a&nbsp; 5,500,000 berry bounty. Who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:37.320
knows what your fellow fishmen did&nbsp;
to get a higher bounty than you?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:42.960
Above him at 7,000,000, there’s a really&nbsp;
unique occurrence: This bounty belongs to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:48.720
Nyaban brothers, Sham and Buchi who worked for&nbsp;
Captain Kuro, the main antagonist of the Syrup&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:54.660
Village arc where the crew recruited Usopp..&nbsp;
Like…they share it. And as far as I can see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:59.640
these brothers are the only characters in all of&nbsp;
One Piece where two different characters share a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:04.740
single bounty between them. For all you bounty&nbsp;
hunters out there, it’s a two for one deal.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.640
After them, it’s right back over to Baroque Works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:13.440
with Miss Valentine who boasts&nbsp;
a bounty of 7,500,000 berries.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.180
Above Miss Valentine is Luffy’s caretaker&nbsp;
/ the closest thing he has to a mother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.660
Curly Dadan. This mountain&nbsp;
bandit who raised Luffy and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:28.320
Ace after Garp dropped them off in the&nbsp;
Goa Kingdom has a bounty of 7,800,000.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:33.540
And shockingly, with a bounty above everyone&nbsp;
we’ve seen so far, is the very first bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:38.700
we saw in the whole series: And it’s&nbsp;
another mountain bandit just like Dadan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:44.040
but without her heart of gold. That’s&nbsp;
right, it’s Higuma, AKA the guy that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:48.840
Shanks absolutely wrecked in chapter one&nbsp;
of One Piece with a bounty of 8,000,000.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:54.120
Exactly tied with that mountain bandit is&nbsp;
the second best swordsman in Fishman Island:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:58.860
Hatchan. He earned his bounty as part of&nbsp;
the Arlong Pirates, but I wonder if the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:03.480
marines would still honor that deal now that&nbsp;
Hatchan is just a humble takoyaki salesman.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:09.060
However, I’m pretty sure the next bounty&nbsp;
has been erased because it belongs to Jango&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.920
the Hypnotist. He had a 9,000,000 berry bounty&nbsp;
when he was working for the Black Cat Pirates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:18.180
but now that he’s switched sides and joined&nbsp;
the marines, he’s officially bounty free.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.300
But still at 9,000,000 berries as&nbsp;
far as we know is another Arlong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.320
Pirate - Kuroobi aka the guy with&nbsp;
the pig tails that Sanji fought.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:34.980
At 10,000,000 we have two more pirates.&nbsp;
This random guy who attacked a childhood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:40.680
Trafalgar Law during his flashback and Baroque&nbsp;
Works’ Mr. 5 - aka explosive Lenny Kravitz.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.680
With 11,000,000 berries, we have the heaviest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:48.180
member of the Donquixote Family&nbsp;
and the one with the lowest bounty

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:52.800
And with an inexplicably higher bounty&nbsp;
than a member of Doflamingo’s Crew…is Gin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.240
Don Krieg’s subordinate from the&nbsp;
Baratie arc at 12,000,000 berries.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:00.480
Jumping up another 2 million for 14 million is yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:05.160
another Baroque Works member: the&nbsp;
mole woman, Miss Merry Christmas.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:12.300
And with a strange number, 14,300,000 berries,&nbsp;
we have Bluejam from Luffy’s childhood flashback.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:17.700
At 15 mil, we have this little half- fighting&nbsp;
fishman freak, also from the Donquixote Family.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.280
At 16 million berries, we&nbsp;
have Captain Kuro himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.980
the pirate who wreaked havoc on&nbsp;
Usopp’s home of Syrup Village.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.600
With 17 million, though, we have the main&nbsp;
villain from the Baratie Arc: Don Krieg.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:34.260
And for that same bounty, is this random guy&nbsp;
who was on sale at the Sabaody Auction House.

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:39.900
For 20 million, though, we have the highest&nbsp;
bounty in all of the East Blue (besides Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.640
of course): Arlong. As a former member of&nbsp;
the Sun Pirates who was causing terror in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.960
Cocoyashi Village, no pirate was&nbsp;
more dangerous in the weakest sea.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:52.920
His bounty likely would have been much&nbsp;
higher if he hadn’t been keeping a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:56.820
relatively low profile in the East Blue&nbsp;
and regularly paying off the marines.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:02.760
Another infamous pirate with a bounty&nbsp;
of at least 20 million is Jesus Burgess,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:07.260
the Captain of Blackbeard’s First&nbsp;
Ship. Now, since Blackbeard has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:12.510
become a full-fledged Yonkou, I imagine&nbsp;
Burgess’s bounty is much, much higher now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:17.340
but 20 million is the last confirmed&nbsp;
bounty we actually have for this character.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.820
And two characters who also have the&nbsp;
20 million berry bounty amount are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:25.680
two Yeti Cool Brothers from Punk&nbsp;
Hazard being worth 20 mil each.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:32.580
Our next character is this monkey man who loves to&nbsp;
salvage from the Jaya Arc with 23 million berries.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:37.500
Three characters share a bounty of 24 million&nbsp;
and they’re three of the most random characters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:42.780
you could possibly think of: The wax man,&nbsp;
Mr. 3, Big Mom’s daughter Charlotte Lola,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:47.400
and one of One Piece’s silliest&nbsp;
villains: Foxy the Silver Fox.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:52.500
Above all of them, though, with 25 million&nbsp;
is….Montblanc Cricket, the descendant of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:59.520
Noland the Liar. Who I guess earned this bounty&nbsp;
through the terrible crime of…deep sea diving?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.280
The Captain of the Fake Strawhats from the Return&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:08.820
to Sabaody Archipelago arc has a bounty&nbsp;
of 26 million, which is just sad. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:13.680
Fake Strawhat couldn’t even earn the&nbsp;
amount of Luffy’s very first bounty.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.680
Another Baroque Works agent, Miss Golden Week,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:22.080
AKA the painter girl who worked with Mr.&nbsp;
3 had a bounty of 29 million berries.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.940
For reference, right above that is&nbsp;
Luffy’s first bounty in the East Blue:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:33.660
30,000,000. Just think for a second:&nbsp;
Luffy’s bounty was higher than every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:38.340
character we’ve heard so far before&nbsp;
he even entered the Grand Line!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.720
And at 31 million is the most&nbsp;
explosive member of Doffy’s crew

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:46.620
At 32 mil is the pinnacle of&nbsp;
friendship: Mr. 2 Bon Kurei.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:52.140
His former spiky ally Miss Double Finger,&nbsp;
however had a bounty of 35 million berries.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.260
A few characters share a bounty of 36 million.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.900
First is Shoujou, the other&nbsp;&nbsp;
salvaging gorilla for Jaya.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:01.140
Here at this price we also have the&nbsp;
coliseum fighter Bobby Funk as well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:06.300
as this random guy who got beat up by&nbsp;
the Galley-La shipwrights in Water 7.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.820
At 38 mil is this fashionable friend of Bellamy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.820
who Doflamingo puppeteered&nbsp;
into a fight with his bestie

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.600
Worth 40 million berries each are&nbsp;
the Boa Hancock’s two sisters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.600
Sandersonia and Marigold of Amazon Lily.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.020
But, obviously worth more than the&nbsp;
two sisters of the pirate empress,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:26.280
at 42 million…is this random guy from Jaya

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.880
With a price of at least 42 million,&nbsp;
though, there’s the Demon Sheriff,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:34.020
Lafitte. Just like Jesus Burgess, we can guess&nbsp;
that this high-ranking member of Blackbeard’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:38.160
crew has also seen a big price hike since&nbsp;
he became the subordinate of a Yonkou,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.460
but 42 mil is the last update we’ve&nbsp;
seen to his bounty in the story.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:47.520
For example, he’s gotta be higher than this&nbsp;
52 million berry bounty that belongs to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:51.780
random Blackbeard allied captain who&nbsp;
attacked the Lulusia Kingdom and got&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.780
stomped by the four Revolutionary Army commanders.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:58.740
At 57 mil is the smaller and angrier&nbsp;
of the two Funk Brothers, Kelly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:03.780
and owner of possibly the weirdest devil fruit&nbsp;
in the entire series, the Jacket-Jacket Fruit:

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.720
But not to be outdone, at 58 million,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:10.920
is the most hard-boiled member of&nbsp;
the Donquixote Pirates: Senor Pink.

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:14.400
This pirate whom we met as a slave when&nbsp;
we were first introduced to the Celestial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.160
Dragons on Sabaody Archipelago&nbsp;
is worth 60 million berries

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:21.180
And at 61 mil is the oldest member&nbsp;
of the Doflamingo Family: Lao G.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:24.840
Van Auger, the sniper of the Blackbeard&nbsp;
Pirates, is another Yonkou Commander&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:28.440
that we can only assume has received&nbsp;
a major bounty increase. But for now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:33.000
his last confirmed bounty is&nbsp;
at least 64 million berries.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:38.940
These two lower ranking members of the Straw Hat&nbsp;
Grand Fleet both share a 67 million berry bounty.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:42.300
And now we’re definitely&nbsp;
starting to see a pattern here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:46.140
but Doc Q also probably has&nbsp;
a higher bounty now. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:51.660
for now this Death God of the Blackbeard&nbsp;
Pirates has a bounty of…at least 72 million.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:58.020
This crab hand guy who got wrecked by the&nbsp;
New Fishman Pirates was worth 73 million.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:04.620
Crocodile’s 2nd in command, Daz Bones is worth 75&nbsp;
million for his time in the criminal organization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:09.120
Baroque Works and might be worth even more now&nbsp;
that he’s a high ranking member of the Cross&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:15.780
Guild. Let’s take a minute to compare that&nbsp;
to some other currencies: 75 million yen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:22.560
for my Western viewers, is about 518, 000&nbsp;
US dollars or 476, 000 Euro, so turning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:27.600
Daz Bones into the government could give you&nbsp;
enough to buy a pretty nice house in cash.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:31.560
Robin’s mom, Nico Olvia is&nbsp;
worth 79 million - as we know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.520
anybody familiar with aspects of the Void&nbsp;
Century and the Poneglyphs is definitely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.240
wanted by the government.. Now we’re&nbsp;
starting to get up there, but trust me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:44.640
we’ve barely scratched the surface on the&nbsp;
unbelievably high bounties in One Piece.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:49.560
Brownbeard, objectively the worst of all&nbsp;
the characters who are a color and a beard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.620
is worth the very peculiar bounty amount of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:59.640
80,060,000. Why did the government tack&nbsp;
on that 60,000? The world may never know.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:04.560
This random rookie who joined up with&nbsp;
the Fake Straw Hats was worth 88 mil

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:10.680
And Gotti, Capone Bege’s crew mate and man&nbsp;
with a machine gun for an arm, is worth 90.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:14.400
And at 92, we have this *other*&nbsp;
rookie who joined the Fake Straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.800
Hats and is doing his best mummy impression

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:21.360
Rockstar, one of Shanks’ subordinates in&nbsp;
the Red Hair Pirates is worth 94 million

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.360
And owner of one of the longest&nbsp;
tongues in all of One Piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:28.500
Vito of the Firetank Pirates,&nbsp;
has a bounty of 95 million.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.480
However, now it’s finally time for some crewmates&nbsp;
to share an equal bounty amount. After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:39.780
sharing is caring. And sharing the bounty of&nbsp;
99 million each are the three top executives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:44.880
of the Donquixote Family: Diamante, Pica,&nbsp;
and Trebol. These three powerhouses are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.660
the centerpiece of Doflamingo’s hold over&nbsp;
Dressrosa, running much of the political&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:53.520
machinery of the island. These three were even&nbsp;
responsible for taking in a young Doflamingo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:59.700
and warping him into the maniacal evil he&nbsp;
is today. Now that’s what I call parenting!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:05.340
And finally, we reach the benchmark of 100&nbsp;
million berries: a bounty shared by the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:10.440
captains of the Giant Warrior Pirates: Dorry&nbsp;
and Brogy. Who knows how high their bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:14.220
would be if they had been pirating for&nbsp;
the past century instead of dueling each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:17.520
other on Little Garden? Now that they’re&nbsp;
hanging out with their best bud Shanks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:22.260
though, maybe they’ll finally get a giant&nbsp;
sized bounty to match their…giant size.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:27.000
Also with 100 million was Straw Hat&nbsp;
Luffy after he defeated Sir Crocodile&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:30.840
in Alabasta. After defeating a warlord, the&nbsp;
government really started to take him more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:35.700
seriously as a threat. But that would&nbsp;
be nothing compared to his next bounty.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:41.880
Level 5 of Impel Down only houses prisoners with&nbsp;
bounties over 100 million. So while we don’t know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:47.520
their exact bounty numbers, these three characters&nbsp;
have at least that: there’s this guy who joined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:52.260
up with Buggy after the prison break as well as&nbsp;
the Revolutionaries Emporio Ivankov and Inazuma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:56.760
who were housed in Level 5 before moving&nbsp;
to the secret Level 5.: Newkama Land.

00:12:56.760 --> 00:13:00.780
Now the bounties are getting so high&nbsp;
we’re getting into Yonkou subordinate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:06.180
territory. With 105,500,000 is one&nbsp;
of the first Big Mom crew members&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:10.860
the audience met and one of them who had&nbsp;
the least impact on the story: Bobbin.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:15.180
Now that we’ve crossed the 100 mil threshold,&nbsp;
we also get to highlight Supernovas, starting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:22.320
with the one we’ve seen least in the story: Mad&nbsp;
Monk Urouge who has a 108,000,000 berry bounty.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:28.440
Charlotte Mont D’Or, another Big Mom subordinate&nbsp;
and wielder of the book devil fruit, 120 million.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:34.680
Orlumbus, one of the commanders of the Straw Hat&nbsp;
grand fleet who brought his 4,300 men under Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:39.360
has a bounty of 148 million. In&nbsp;
USD, that would be around 1,022,000,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:44.580
so turning in Orlumbus would make you an&nbsp;
American millionaire. Sadly for Europe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:48.420
though, it’s just shy at around 940,000 Euro.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:57.480
But that’s nothing compared to this pirate&nbsp;
with a staggering 190 million…it’s…Coribou? No,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:01.920
not Caribou - his brother. This just&nbsp;
goes to show that bounties don’t always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:05.940
correspond to strength. Coribou didn’t&nbsp;
earn his high bounty from his power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:09.420
but from he and his brother’s&nbsp;
love of killing marines.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:15.600
Bouncing into the next spot with 195 is&nbsp;
Bellamy, the owner of the Spring-Spring fruit.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:24.900
Sharing a bounty of 200 million are the&nbsp;
ultimate Straw Hat super fan Bartolomeo

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.540
and the supernova that just can’t stop laughing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:33.660
Killer. And just for frame of reference,&nbsp;
that makes these two worth 10 Arlongs each!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.560
Three random characters also happen&nbsp;
to have a bounty of 210 million that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:42.060
are in no way related to each other. We have&nbsp;
Caribou, famous for being Coribou’s brother;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.640
Squard, the Judas of the Whitebeard allies;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:51.060
and Don Sai, another commander of the Straw&nbsp;
Hat Grand Fleet and known Charlos hitter.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:53.940
X-Drake, another Supernova&nbsp;
and secret member of SWORD,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:58.620
has a bounty of 222,000,000. Since&nbsp;
he’s secretly working for the marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:04.260
who knows how legit that bounty is. But since&nbsp;
we know SWORD members have technically resigned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:08.940
from the marines, we bet you could make a&nbsp;
pretty penny by bringing in this allosaurus.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:15.300
At 230,000,000 is Fisher Tiger: After Fisher Tiger&nbsp;
scaled the Red Line with his bare hands and freed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:20.460
the slaves from Mariejois, we’re surprised his&nbsp;
bounty doesn’t the billion mark - but once we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:25.980
get to that point, you’ll see just how crazy&nbsp;
some of the pirates who have that amount are.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:29.100
Page One comes in at 290. As one of the members of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:33.420
the Flying Six, he’s one of Kaidou’s top&nbsp;
subordinates and has a bounty to match.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:40.140
A little bit higher at 293 million&nbsp; is Morley of&nbsp;
the Revolutionary Army - obviously a Revolutionary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:44.220
deserves a big bounty, but she also has the&nbsp;
distinction of being one of the few people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:49.500
to ever break out of Impel Down…well,&nbsp;
before the massive breakout, of course.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.540
Bartholomew Kuma, the king turned revolutionary&nbsp;
turned warlord&nbsp; turned cyborg turned slave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.920
has a bounty of 296 million.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:03.180
Three characters share a bounty of 300&nbsp;
million: The first is Caesar Clown,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:08.220
whose evil scientist exploits and many weapons&nbsp;
of mass destruction soundly earn him that high&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:13.680
bounty. The next two, though, are two brothers&nbsp;
who Caesar would absolutely not like to run into,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:18.720
lest he be imprisoned by Big Mom again. That&nbsp;
would be Charlotte Oven and Charlotte Daifuku,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:23.400
the triplet brothers of Katakuri, and two of Big&nbsp;
Mom’s strongest non Sweet-Commander children.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:27.960
However, those aren’t the only&nbsp;
characters who’ve had a 300 million&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:32.160
berry bounty - this was also Luffy’s&nbsp;
bounty after the Straw Hats’ all out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:36.540
assault on Enies Lobby where they officially&nbsp;
declared war against the world government.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:40.140
Lindbergh, another Revolutionary&nbsp;
Army commander has earned a bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:44.100
of 316 million for his rebellious&nbsp;
actions against the World Government.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:49.800
Three characters also share the bounty amount&nbsp;
of 320 million. The first two are members of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:54.900
Worst Generation: First, Basil Hawkins, who served&nbsp;
under Kaidou as one of his headliners (and judging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:54.900 --> 00:17:01.380
by those marks on his forehead…the most literal&nbsp;
headliner). Second, we have Jewelry Bonney,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:05.220
the daughter of Bartholomew Kuma. We’re&nbsp;
sure that whatever part of Kuma is still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:09.840
conscious is very proud of his daughter for&nbsp;
achieving a higher bounty than her old man.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:14.820
The third pirate with a 320 million&nbsp;
berry bounty is a former Shichibukai,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:21.120
Gekko Moriah. Turns out stealing and&nbsp;
reanimating corpses is a severe crime. Who knew?

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:25.800
The 330 million berry bounty also goes to two&nbsp;
different pirates, the first being Pekoms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:29.520
the mink subordinate of Big Mom and&nbsp;
the second being another commander&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:33.360
of the Straw Hat Grand Fleet:&nbsp;
Cavendish of the Beautiful Pirates.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:38.580
Donquixote Doflamingo feels surprisingly low on&nbsp;
the list considering how many more characters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:43.680
with higher bounties we have left. Of course,&nbsp;
we have to factor in that his bounty of 340&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:48.300
million was frozen when he was granted Warlord&nbsp;
status. Had his bounty been able to increase,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.940
I’m sure his position as an&nbsp;
underworld broker and arms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:54.840
dealer would have earned him a higher&nbsp;
bounty. He might just be able to call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:58.860
in a favor with the Celestial Dragons to&nbsp;
keep it nice and low if he wants, though.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:03.900
At 350 million there are two more&nbsp;
Supernovas: First is Capone Bege,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:08.820
the #1 dad in all of One Piece (which isn’t&nbsp;
really that high of a bar to cross) and second&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:13.800
is Scratchmen Apoo, who really ought to&nbsp;
see a dentist about those piano teeth.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:19.140
The fact that we’re just now getting to&nbsp;
our first non-Chopper Straw Hat really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:23.760
shows just how infamous our crew has&nbsp;
become now that Luffy has officially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:30.240
become a Yonkou. Cat Burglar Nami has&nbsp;
a bounty of 366 million, and I’m sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:35.220
she’s glad she’s on the relatively lower end&nbsp;
of the spectrum compared to her crewmates.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:41.640
Pedro - RIP - had a bounty of 382,000,000&nbsp;
before his death on whole Cake Island.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:46.800
Up next we have two more Straw Hats: Soul&nbsp;
King Brook has a bounty of 383 million and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:52.440
Cyborg Franky has a bounty of 394 million.&nbsp;
Fitting for two of the crewmates who went&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:56.580
up against the terrifying Big Mom. I mean,&nbsp;
what other pirate can say they motorcycled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:56.580 --> 00:19:01.440
Big Mom in the face? And Brook managed to&nbsp;
do the impossible: he spent a night in Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:07.200
Mom’s bed and actually survived. Even&nbsp;
though he’s already dead. Yohohohoho.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:12.540
Sharing a bounty of 400 million are the&nbsp;
hard-headed Ulti from Kaidou’s crew and Karasu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.600
Revolutionary Army commander and&nbsp;
wielder of the Soot Soot fruit.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.700
400 million was also the bounty&nbsp;
that Luffy earned after leading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:27.060
an unprecedented prison break out of Impel&nbsp;
Down and participating in the Marineford War.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:33.240
Big Mom’s egg-y subordinate, Baron&nbsp;
Tamago, has a bounty of 429 million.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:40.800
Another Revolutionary Army Commander,&nbsp;
Belo Betty, is worth 457 million - fitting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.640
for someone with the perfect fruit for&nbsp;
inciting riots against the government.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.020
Sasaki of Kaidou’s Flying&nbsp;
Six has a bounty of 472 mil.

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:53.940
And another member of the Flying Six,&nbsp;
Black Maria, is worth 480 million,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:59.820
an amount she shares with the former warlord&nbsp;
and alleged son of Whitebeard, Edward Weevil.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:07.740
The sniper king himself, God Usopp, is our first&nbsp;
pirate to cross the half billion threshold with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:15.540
500 million. This is kind of insane because that&nbsp;
means that one Usopp is worth one million Bepos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.100
Of course, this is also the number that&nbsp;
Luffy earned after the Straw Hats dethroned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.580
Doflamingo and freed the island of&nbsp;
Dressrosa from the corrupt warlord.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.220
Izo, one of the 9 red scabbards and former member&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:31.140
of the Whitebeard Pirates was worth 510&nbsp;
million before their death on Onigashima.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:34.560
Don Chinjao, former enemy of&nbsp;
Garp and current ally of Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:40.140
is worth 542 million, which just goes to show:&nbsp;
the pointier the head, the higher the bounty.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:44.160
Who’s Who, Kaidou’s subordinate who&nbsp;
was formerly a member of the CP9&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.660
has a bounty of 546 mil. As the&nbsp;
person who was held responsible

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:56.220
Little Oars Jr - a descendant of the ancient&nbsp;
giant Oars - has a bounty of 550 million - a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:56.220 --> 00:21:01.140
bounty he shared with his friend Portgas D.&nbsp;
Ace. As a division commander of the Whitebeard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:06.540
Pirates and the son of Gol D. Roger himself,&nbsp;
Ace definitely earned his massive bounty.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:14.280
Charlotte Snack is one of Big Mom’s children&nbsp;
we still haven’t met. He was one of her Sweet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:19.080
Commanders before he was defeated by the Mad Monk&nbsp;
Urouge off-screen prior to the Whole Cake Island&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:23.100
arc. One thing we *do* know about Snack,&nbsp;
though, is that his bounty is 600,000,000.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.260
Just a bit higher at 602 million is the&nbsp;
Revolutionary Army’s Chief of Staff:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:33.000
The Flame Emperor Sabo. As the 2nd in command for&nbsp;
the biggest thorn in the world government’s side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:37.680
it’s no surprise that this bounty is&nbsp;
higher. We do suspect an increase soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:42.660
though, considering that Sabo learned the&nbsp;
government’s greatest secret during the Reverie.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:48.300
Charlotte Perospero, Big Mom’s eldest son,&nbsp;
reaches a bounty of 700,000,000 - higher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:52.020
than one of the Sweet Commanders even&nbsp;
though he doesn’t hold the title himself.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:56.460
However, he’s not as high as our next&nbsp;
Big Mom child: Charlotte Cracker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:56.460 --> 00:22:02.880
who gave even Gear 4th Luffy a tough battle&nbsp;
on Whole Cake and has a bounty of 860 million.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:08.220
Taking a short break from the Charlottes, though,&nbsp;
we have the Devil Child herself: Nico Robin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:14.640
who has a bounty of 930 million. Being one of&nbsp;
the only people in the world who can read the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:18.660
poneglyphs, Robin is one of the most dangerous&nbsp;
individuals for the World Government. Therefore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:24.420
she earns a bounty just as high as many characters&nbsp;
who are physically much stronger than her.

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:26.520
Slightly higher than Robin, though, is yet another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:30.360
Sweet Commander - Charlotte&nbsp;
Smoothie with 932 million.

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:36.120
But next comes our first billion berry&nbsp;
bounty: before meeting this character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:41.160
we could hardly conceive of a bounty so high&nbsp;
- we’d never seen anything like it in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:47.280
series. With a 1,000,000,000 berry bounty is&nbsp;
one of Kaidou’s All-Stars, Jack the Drought.

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:54.180
Black Leg Sanji is our first Straw Hat to break&nbsp;
a billion, being worth 1, 032,000,000. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:59.160
an earlier bounty of Sanji’s is definitely&nbsp;
interesting to look at. His bounty poster&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:04.920
after Dressrosa which was worth 177 million&nbsp;
is the only poster in the series we’ve seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:10.560
that says “Only Alive” instead of “Dead or Alive.”&nbsp;
This was due to the interference of the Vinsmoke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:16.320
Family whose Germa Kingdom is a member nation of&nbsp;
the World Government. Vinsmoke Judge wanted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:22.320
keep his long lost son alive as a political pawn&nbsp;
to marry into the Charlotte Family. That didn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:22.320 --> 00:23:28.260
work out too well for him. On his next bounty,&nbsp;
Sanji returned to being wanted Dead or Alive.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:32.700
But above him is the first billion berry&nbsp;
man that Luffy went head to head with.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:37.620
The future-sight master and strongest of&nbsp;
Big Mom’s children, Charlotte Katakuri,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:43.080
with 1,057,000,000. Fun Fact: Since Luffy&nbsp;
is heavily associated with the number 56,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:48.960
which can be read as Go-Mu in Japanese, Katakuri’s&nbsp;
bounty having a 57 million in it was Oda’s way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:53.520
of hinting at the Mochi User’s superiority&nbsp;
to Luffy at the beginning of their fight.

00:23:55.920 --> 00:24:01.080
The Knight of the Sea, Jinbe, has a bounty&nbsp;
of 1,100,000,000 now that he’s one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:05.400
most powerful commanders of the Straw Hat&nbsp;
Grand Fleet. Add his former status as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:08.580
Shichibukai and leader of the Sun&nbsp;
Pirates and you get someone with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:13.920
resumé so crazy that he’s surpassed Sanji&nbsp;
for the third highest bounty in the crew.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:24.360
And just above him at 1,111,000,000&nbsp;
is Roronoa Zoro who handily deserves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:24.360 --> 00:24:28.020
a billion plus bounty after taking&nbsp;
out Kaidou’s 2nd in command. Hmmm,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:28.020 --> 00:24:32.940
maybe all of those ones are supposed to be&nbsp;
hinting at something - like how he’s Luffy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:36.900
*unofficial* first mate? Maybe someday&nbsp;
he’ll finally earn that title for real.

00:24:38.400 --> 00:24:45.240
Queen the Plague has a bounty of 1,320,000,000.&nbsp;
It’s higher than even Sanji and Zoro’s bounties,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:45.240 --> 00:24:50.100
but you have to remember that bounties aren’t&nbsp;
just power levels. They also have to do with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:50.100 --> 00:24:55.200
a pirates’ threat level both to the government&nbsp;
itself and society as a whole. But while no one’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:55.200 --> 00:25:00.060
getting food poisoning from Sanji’s expertly&nbsp;
crafted plates, Queen does have a habit of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:00.060 --> 00:25:05.580
releasing terrible diseases of his own design&nbsp;
onto victims, hence his nickname “The Plague.”

00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:11.880
Marco the Phoenix comes in at 1,374,000,000&nbsp;
- the former second in command of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:11.880 --> 00:25:15.960
Whitebeard Pirates is powerful&nbsp;
enough to take on King and Queen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:15.960 --> 00:25:21.600
at the same time. And I have a feeling that&nbsp;
the World Government wouldn’t look too kindly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:21.600 --> 00:25:24.960
upon the new leader of the Whitebeard&nbsp;
Pirates after the Marineford War pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:31.140
much demolished the Marine Headquarters. This&nbsp;
is all the perfect recipe for a massive bounty.

00:25:31.140 --> 00:25:38.280
However, it’s not quite as massive as King the&nbsp;
Wildfire, who has a 1,390,000,000 berry bounty. As&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:38.280 --> 00:25:43.260
the last known Lunarian and a prized government&nbsp;
test subject who escaped from Punk Hazard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:43.260 --> 00:25:48.060
the World Government has every reason to&nbsp;
want to get King back. And this motivation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:48.060 --> 00:25:54.000
gets even higher when you think about how much&nbsp;
King seems to know about the legend of Joyboy.

00:25:54.600 --> 00:25:58.380
After Whole Cake Island, where Luffy&nbsp;
stormed a Yonkou’s territory to free Sanji,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:58.380 --> 00:26:02.520
he earned a new bounty of 1,500,000,000 after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:02.520 --> 00:26:07.140
being named the 5th Emperor of the&nbsp;
sea, his sixth bounty in the series.

00:26:08.580 --> 00:26:13.800
Boa Hancock, the Pirate Empress of Amazon Lily&nbsp;
and former warlord of the sea has a new bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:13.800 --> 00:26:20.100
of 1,659,000,000. After the warlord system was&nbsp;
abolished, she was one of the former Shichibukai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:20.100 --> 00:26:25.500
who achieved a huge bounty. With her dangerous&nbsp;
devil fruit capable of turning anyone to stone and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:25.500 --> 00:26:31.320
a country’s worth of haki-using warriors at her&nbsp;
disposal, she’s truly a force to be reckoned with.

00:26:31.320 --> 00:26:35.640
Sir Crocodile is the first warlord the&nbsp;
Straw Hats ever fought and he was their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:35.640 --> 00:26:39.360
first true test of strength in the Grand&nbsp;
Line. Now that he’s a leader of the Cross&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:44.520
Guild and actively issuing bounties on&nbsp;
high-profile marines, he’s surged to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:44.520 --> 00:26:50.640
top of the government’s most wanted list&nbsp;
with a bounty of 1,965,000,000 berries.

00:26:50.640 --> 00:26:55.440
And for the next place on our list, there’s a&nbsp;
three way tie. For toppling the former yonkou&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:55.440 --> 00:27:00.360
Kaidou and Big Mom, the alliance of Monkey D.&nbsp;
Luffy, Eustass Kid, and Trafalgar Law have all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:00.360 --> 00:27:05.280
earned massive bounties of 3 billion berries.&nbsp;
This just shows how seriously the government are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:05.280 --> 00:27:09.480
taking the worst generation now that they’ve made&nbsp;
a real name for themselves in the New World. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:09.480 --> 00:27:13.920
is Luffy’s current bounty, but I’ve got a feeling&nbsp;
it’ll go even higher before the end of the series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:19.800
which is insane because it’s a whole 100 times&nbsp;
higher than his original bounty of 30,000,000.

00:27:29.340 --> 00:27:35.820
But even above these three is the fearsome, the&nbsp;
almighty, Buggy the Clown. His bounty is now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:35.820 --> 00:27:42.900
a staggering 3,189,000,000 - fitting for one of&nbsp;
the four emperors and a prime candidate for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:48.600
pirate that will claim the One Piece and become&nbsp;
the pirate king. After failing upwards all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:48.600 --> 00:27:54.180
way from the East Blue, this former cabin boy for&nbsp;
Roger has ascended to the top of the pirate world.

00:27:57.120 --> 00:28:02.280
Of course, Dracule Mihawk keeps him in check&nbsp;
- or at least tries to. This is the true&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:02.280 --> 00:28:06.420
powerhouse of the Cross Guild and the World’s&nbsp;
Greatest Swordsman. According to Crocodile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:06.420 --> 00:28:10.920
he was known as a marine hunter before he&nbsp;
was named a Shichibukai. But now that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:15.720
warlord system has been dissolved,&nbsp;
his bounty is now 3,590,000,000.

00:28:18.540 --> 00:28:25.200
Marshall D. Teach AKA Blackbeard has&nbsp;
a bounty of 3,996,000,000 berries. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:25.200 --> 00:28:29.160
started his pirate career on Whitebeard’s&nbsp;
crew, achieved the status of Shichibukai,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:29.160 --> 00:28:34.080
and broke some of the most terrifying prisoners&nbsp;
out of Impel Down to join his crew. This would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:34.080 --> 00:28:38.700
already be worth a huge bounty, but then you&nbsp;
add the fact that he’s the only person ever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:38.700 --> 00:28:43.800
known to consume two devil fruits and they’re&nbsp;
two of the most destructive and powerful ones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:43.800 --> 00:28:47.820
in the entire world. After he conquered&nbsp;
the remains of Whitebeard’s territory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:47.820 --> 00:28:52.140
he established himself as an emperor of&nbsp;
the sea with a massive bounty to match.

00:28:52.920 --> 00:28:57.060
Before the end of the list with some&nbsp;
unbelievably high bounties, though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:57.060 --> 00:29:02.400
it’s time for some honorable mentions: There&nbsp;
are some characters with unknown bounties&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:02.400 --> 00:29:06.480
that we’re sure would be among the highest&nbsp;
that have yet to be revealed. For instance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:06.480 --> 00:29:11.400
what was Rocks D. Xebec’s bounty? We also don’t&nbsp;
know many members of the Blackbeard, Red Hair,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:11.400 --> 00:29:15.780
or Roger Pirates’ bounties. And we assume the&nbsp;
highest bounty belongs to the “world’s most wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:15.780 --> 00:29:21.600
man” and Luffy’s father, Monkey D. Dragon. But&nbsp;
until we find out for sure, we can only speculate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:21.600 --> 00:29:28.620
how crazy high these bounties were. Now it’s&nbsp;
time for the top 5 highest bounties in One Piece.

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:44.220
In 5th place is the mysterious Red-Haired Shanks,&nbsp;
worth 4,048,900,000. Why such a huge bounty? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:44.220 --> 00:29:48.720
let’s look at what we do know about this&nbsp;
enigmatic figure: He served on Roger’s crew,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:48.720 --> 00:29:52.980
and he stole the Sun God Nika fruit from the&nbsp;
World Government and gave it to Luffy. Moreover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:52.980 --> 00:29:56.880
though, he’s almost certainly connected to&nbsp;
the Figarland Family of the Celestial Dragons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:59.880
having been found by Roger&nbsp;
as an infant on God Valley.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:59.880 --> 00:30:05.280
Add his insane conqueror’s haki feat&nbsp;
and he’s easily worth over 4 billion.

00:30:07.860 --> 00:30:12.720
And the other original four emperors also&nbsp;
possess bounties above 4 billion. Charlotte&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:12.720 --> 00:30:18.540
Lin Lin, otherwise known as Big Mom, was worth&nbsp;
4,388,000,000 berries before her defeat on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:18.540 --> 00:30:22.740
Onigashima. As a former Rocks Pirate member and&nbsp;
one of the emperors of the sea, she cemented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:22.740 --> 00:30:28.320
her status as one of the strongest pirates in the&nbsp;
world. Her Soul-Soul fruit is insanely versatile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:28.320 --> 00:30:33.420
her durability is incredible, and&nbsp;
her taste for sweets unparalleled.

00:30:33.420 --> 00:30:37.020
Her former Rocks Crew Mate Kaidou&nbsp;
was known as the world’s strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:37.020 --> 00:30:39.960
creature. As a young pirate, he broke&nbsp;
free from government experimentation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:40.680 --> 00:30:45.000
at Punk Hazard. After partnering with&nbsp;
Orochi and conquering the land of Wano,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:48.420
he became a warlord and was one of&nbsp;
the biggest arms dealers in the world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:48.420 --> 00:30:57.600
even having the government itself as a client.&nbsp;
All of this earned him a bounty of 4,611,100,000

00:30:58.140 --> 00:31:04.140
And yet another Rocks Crew member and the&nbsp;
strongest man in the world was Edward Newgate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:04.140 --> 00:31:07.320
better known as Whitebeard.&nbsp;
This user of the quake-quake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:07.320 --> 00:31:10.680
fruit who was even able to wage war&nbsp;
against the full forces of the World&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:10.680 --> 00:31:15.060
Government even while terminally&nbsp;
ill had a bounty of 5,046,000,000.

00:31:17.700 --> 00:31:22.260
But even he can’t compete with the highest known&nbsp;
bounty in all of One Piece. With a bounty of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:25.680 --> 00:31:29.700
5,564,800,000 is the king of the pirates&nbsp;
himself, the man who found Laugh Tale and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:29.700 --> 00:31:33.600
started the golden age of piracy: Gol&nbsp;
D. Roger. To put that in perspective,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:33.600 --> 00:31:40.140
that’s about 38.5 million US dollars and around&nbsp;
35 million Euro. It’s too late to collect on it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:40.140 --> 00:31:43.260
but just imagine what you could&nbsp;
do with that chunk of change.

00:31:43.260 --> 00:31:48.120
These bounties are insanely high, but if&nbsp;
you want to see how crazy the Straw Hats’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:48.120 --> 00:31:52.200
bounties will be at the end of the series,&nbsp;
